    "sections": {
        "description": "Corporate Consultancy is designed for professional service firms that need a clean, structured, and business-focused website. It is suitable for consulting firms, financial advisors, business consultants, legal firms, marketing agencies, startups, and corporate service providers who want to present their services, team, case studies, and client information in a clear and organized way. The layout focuses on service sections, team profiles, testimonials, project showcases, and contact information, which are essential for business websites. It supports responsive design, customizable layouts, service pages, blog sections, and SEO-friendly structure, helping businesses maintain an informative online presence. Corporate Consultancy can also be used by accountants, HR agencies, management consultants, and professional service providers who need a corporate website with simple navigation and professional design. The theme structure is suitable for corporate websites, business websites, consulting services, financial services, and professional agency websites that require clear content presentation and easy navigation for users."
    },
